        "materials": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Honest materials",
            "text": "<p>Solid American hardwood — maple, walnut, mahogany — from sustainably managed US forests. Finished with Odie's Universal Oil: food safe, solvent free, no heavy metals. Every material is listed on every product page, including the ones that aren't glamorous.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "photographs": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Truthful photographs",
            "text": "<p>What you see is the piece you get. Real wood, real grain, real light. We don't render, we don't retouch away a knot, and we show the variation you should expect — because the variation is the point.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "speed": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Made to order, shipped in days",
            "text": "<p>Most makers quote two to three months. Small pieces leave our shop within three business days, large pieces within ten. Made by hand, one at a time, and still on your floor this month.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
