          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every piece is inspected before it's packed. If yours arrives damaged, or it isn't what the page described, tell us and we'll make it right.</p><p>You cancel free until we start cutting. After that we ask only for the cost of the wood — your species, in your size, already bought and cut for you. Nothing beyond that. No restocking fee.</p><p>We'd rather lose the sale than lose your trust.</p>"
